<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal building sector buoyant, outlook good.</title>
<headline>Portugal building sector buoyant, outlook good.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector construction work grew strongly in the first five months of 1997 and the outlook for the future remains bright, the National Association of Public Works (ANEOP) said.</p>
<p>Cement sales in the first five months rose 6.8 percent year-on-year, while steel sales were up 32 percent in the first two months of 1997, it said.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
